{"unit_id":"KhaosGx__dsh-stop-service#card-zh","repo":"KhaosGx/dsh-stop-service","commit":"98b539b67c93b30cc3a6f5176e246055c1d7d5c2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stop-service 是面向 DSH Web 的服务控制插件，在设置页提供实时宿主信息与操作入口。宿主侧注册健康检查、状态查询和停止路由，浏览器侧注册服务控制面板及设置页快捷按钮。面板展示进程、运行时间、会话、CPU、内存、版本和已加载插件，可查看资源趋势、复制诊断信息、检查更新、确认停止服务，或等待运行任务结束后停止。适合需要从浏览器管理本机 DSH Web 宿主的使用者；无需额外密钥，更新提示会查询 npm registry。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:198-284","lib/client.js:270-438","lib/client.js:493-525","lib/client.js:633-810"]}
{"unit_id":"KhaosGx__dsh-stop-service#card-en","repo":"KhaosGx/dsh-stop-service","commit":"98b539b67c93b30cc3a6f5176e246055c1d7d5c2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-stop-service adds a service panel and quick-stop button to DSH Web settings. It shows host status, sessions, CPU, memory, versions, and loaded plugins, with trends, copied diagnostics, and update notices. Users can confirm a stop or wait for active tasks to finish. It needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:198-284","lib/client.js:270-438","lib/client.js:493-525","lib/client.js:633-810"]}
